# Claude-assist development notes.
# Per-addon CLAUDE.md handoff docs ARE tracked since 2026-06-11 (cross-machine dev needs them).
# DODO_ADDONS.md is tracked again since 2026-08-22, for that same reason: it is the only place
# the cross-machine conventions are written down, and while it was ignored (c3d9aec, 2026-06-10)
# only whichever machine held the file could read them. Do NOT ignore it again.
# NOTE for publishing: exclude CLAUDE.md from CurseForge zips - it's dev notes, not addon content.
# (Root-level .md never reaches a CurseForge zip anyway: the packaging step in
#  .github/workflows/curseforge-release.yml only walks the addon's own folder.)
# Top-level working notes below stay local, not published.
# PUBLISHING.md: absent on HOME (whole-disk search, 2026-08-22) and never tracked in git
# (git log --all --diff-filter=A -- '*PUBLISHING*' is empty) => it can never travel between
# machines. Do not cite it as the release authority; the release ritual lives in
# .github/workflows/curseforge-release.yml and in DODO_ADDONS.md.
PUBLISHING.md

# Local publishing staging area (screenshots, zips for CurseForge uploads).
.publish/

# Generated by DodoInspect/tools/scan_statpriority.py (page + DB2 cache) and python.
DodoInspect/tools/.scan-cache/
__pycache__/
